# Go build artifacts, ~25 MB each. record-hero.sh and the pod harnesses build
# them into the working tree on purpose (rather than dropping them somewhere
# global), so they sit next to their sources and `git add -A engine` will
# happily stage them if they are not named here.
engine/serve
engine/bake
engine/replay
engine/demosrv
tools/
viz/public/network.geojson
__pycache__/
.wrangler/
# External-review archives: commit the reviews (brief, diffstat, model
# outputs), not the reviewed-patch snapshots — multi-MB each, and
# byte-reproducible from git (ADR-0013 addendum 2026-08-04).
docs/kb/raw/reviews/*-reviewed.patch
